## Work Item

- Work Item ID: TASK-AI-155
- Feature ID: N/A — reusable server-driven data table and dashboard shell
- Work Item file: docs/product-spec/work-items/TASK-AI-155.md
- Assigned implementation author: GEMINI
- Business outcome: Provide apps/web with a unified, reusable server-driven data table and responsive dashboard shell architecture ported from MIT open-source references (sadmann7/shadcn-table and Kiranism/next-shadcn-dashboard-starter, no Clerk). This establishes canonical UI primitives for order lists, reconciliation statement tables, exception workboxes, and administrative grids, ensuring consistent URL search parameter state synchronization (pagination, sorting, search, faceted filters), Vietnamese localization, WCAG AA accessibility, and full state coverage (loading skeleton, empty, error with retry, and interactive normal states) while strictly preserving existing feature screens untouched in this Pull Request.

## Source requirements

- Feature/rule/acceptance IDs: BR-UI-01 (URL State Synchronization), BR-UI-02 (State Completeness), BR-UI-03 (Accessibility / a11y), BR-UI-04 (Vietnamese Localization), BR-UI-05 (Fixture Isolation), AC-AI-155-01 through AC-AI-155-11.
- Screen/API/entity/state IDs: Reusable component modules under apps/web/src/components/data-table/, apps/web/src/components/dashboard/, and Storybook showcase page at apps/web/src/app/storybook/page.tsx. Zero database tables, migrations, or backend API routes modified.
- Source documents: docs/product-spec/docs/00-control/BASELINE-AND-DECISIONS.md, docs/product-spec/docs/03-ux/DESIGN-SYSTEM-UX-RULES.md, AGENTS.md, docs/product-spec/work-items/TASK-AI-155.md, and upstream MIT reference repositories:
  - sadmann7/shadcn-table (MIT License; sort, filter, faceted filter, pagination via URL search params)
  - Kiranism/next-shadcn-dashboard-starter (MIT License; dashboard layout, collapsible sidebar, page-header patterns without Clerk)

