## Safety and recovery

- Tenant isolation: N/A — reusable UI presentation component slice; no tenant-owned data mutations.
- Authorization: Presentation components respect disabled and hidden actions; server-authoritative guard patterns maintained.
- Idempotency/reconciliation: URL state updates accumulate deterministically via pending query ref, preventing out-of-order parameter loss.
- Sensitive data/secrets: All demonstration fixture data prefixed with `fix-` and masked phone numbers; zero credentials or live customer PII.
- Error, timeout and recovery paths: `DataTable` error state includes descriptive error message and actionable "Thử lại" (Retry) callback; empty state provides "Đặt lại bộ lọc" (Reset filters) recovery CTA.
- Carrier capability/evidence level: N/A — no live carrier calls.

